          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Misconfiguration: hostNetwork Enabled\n\nThe DaemonSet 'calico-node' in namespace 'kube-system' is configured with hostNetwork: true.\n\nThis allows the pod to share the host's network namespace, which can lead to network privilege escalation and bypass of network policies.\n\nRemediation: Remove hostNetwork: true unless the workload requires direct host network access."
          },
